From: richie-rich90454 <rjiang880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0005/0014] Remove AI features

This patch removes Copilot Chat, ChatService, InlineChatService,
LanguageModelService and their UI surfaces, @vscode/prompt-tsx, the
"Continue with GitHub Copilot" onboarding flow, user-visible
"Copilot"/"AI"/"chat" references, and the copilot extension
recommendations.

Rationale: no AI feature ships in the IDE. Users may install an
extension from Open VSX; none is shipped or endorsed.

Touches:
  - built-in extension github.copilot-chat (removed)
  - workbench chat/inline-chat/language-model services and UI

Diff: authored on the upstream checkout (see build.sh).
Verification: patch regression test fails without it and passes with it.
